  "goodToKnow": "Die Absprache is an agreement or arrangement: eine Absprache treffen, nach Absprache (by arrangement, common in job ads and on shop doors), in Absprache mit. Illegal Preisabsprachen (price-fixing) are punished by the Bundeskartellamt. The verb absprechen means to agree on something (Wir haben uns abgesprochen) but also to deny someone something: jemandem das Talent absprechen. Plural: die Absprachen."
